"base: a theme to start from (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 to ink-2 (the background), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds and nx (each system's), glass, line, good, warn, bad and focus, as #rrggbb. corners: 0 square to 1.5 round. motif: side, none or eden."
